site event_cancel     0x004674cc 0xe92d40f8 0xe30063b8

# ---- PAD-420: the game's own light shows (pad_mode_runtime.c "the game's own light shows", PAD-411's
# route): each a process body of the game's that lights lamps, played as process show_proc (an id the game
# never uses), its lamp groups freed as it ends (lamp_free_owner). Every candidate was played in the emulator
# with the lamp groups the show process owned recorded, and on the light-language builds the light runner's
